#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After merging the backward and tightened forward bounds, the behavior of the combined SLCs becomes clear:\n"
msgstr "Setelah menggabungkan backward bounds dan tightened forward bounds, perilaku dari SLC gabungan menjadi jelas:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The function above tells us that a partition is chosen at which the switch from backward to tightened forward bounds takes place.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi di atas memberi tahu kita bahwa sebuah partisi dipilih di mana peralihan dari backward ke tightened forward bounds terjadi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
